# Geography

Read `docs/GEOGRAPHY.md` fully before editing.

- Never process raw GeoJSON in the browser at runtime.
- Document source, version, license, and preprocessing in `docs/GEOGRAPHY.md`.
- Use stable country IDs — not display names as primary keys.
- Keep geometry and metadata separate.
- Handle MultiPolygon, antimeridian, and pole edge cases.
- Simplify geometry at build time with deterministic output.
- Test coordinate conversion with unit tests (equator, poles, antimeridian).
- Country meshes sit on the sphere with controlled offset — no z-fighting or floating seams.

Performance: `docs/PERFORMANCE.md` (measure vertex count, draw calls, asset size).
